# Compatibility

Read product maturity from `.cursor/project.md`.

| Maturity | Default |
|----------|---------|
| `wip` | Replace in place. No dual-path, migrators, or forever aliases unless the user asks. |
| `stable` / `public` | Prefer a clean break, but ask before dropping callers or shipped interfaces. |

If maturity is missing or the change might break existing users, ask: clean cut, temporary workaround, or keep backwards compatibility.
